      "options": {
        "dimensions": 1,
        "factor": 100
      },
      "expected": "?]@^_@A",
      "note": "The source encodes these values one by one with no deltas (encodeSignedIntegers / encodeFloats). polytini with dimensions 1 encodes deltas, so the input here is the running sum of the source values."
